spec: S06-01, S06-14

The ticket's scenario end to end: `limited` holds `read,comment` on `notes` only. Its reply on
a Thread succeeds, its `act` on the same Document fails with exit 4 naming `action`, and once an
owner grants `action` the same call succeeds. Merged stdout+stderr.

```console
$ annotary -p rowan push acc-plan.md
acc-plan	[..]	v1

$ annotary -p rowan thread new acc-plan --document -m "Thoughts? @limited"
t1	document

$ annotary -p limited thread reply acc-plan t1 -m "Looks good."
t1.1

$ annotary -p limited act acc-plan approve
? 4
error: missing right `action` on Vault notes (you are @limited) — ask an owner: annotary member grant limited notes action

$ annotary -p limited status acc-plan
acc-plan	[..]	v1	action:-	open:1	mentions-me:1	seq:[..]

$ annotary -p rowan member grant limited notes read,comment,action
@limited	Limited Agent	member	notes:read,comment,action

$ annotary -p limited act acc-plan approve
acc-plan	v1	approve	by @limited

$ annotary -p rowan member grant limited notes read,comment
@limited	Limited Agent	member	notes:read,comment

$ annotary -p limited push acc-plan.md --doc acc-plan
? 4
error: blob upload needs the `write` right on a Vault (you are @limited) — ask an owner: annotary member grant limited VAULT write

```
